- Changed `Variable.get` calls in `dags/gemini_ai_pipeline.py` and `dags/github_repo_monitor.py` to use `default_var=""` instead of `"DEMO_MODE"`.
- Updated conditional logic to check for falsy token values rather than matching the `"DEMO_MODE"` string.
- Documented learning in `.jules/sentinel.md` regarding the security risks of hardcoded fallback strings.

Co-authored-by: google-labs-jules[bot] <161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>
